## Technical Architecture & Data Flow Diagram

PooreYouTuber provides client-side web tools designed for content creators, web developers, office administrators, and digital managers.

### System Flow
```
User
  │
  ▼
Browser (Client Sandbox)
  │
  ▼
HTML5 / CSS3 / JavaScript (Canvas, Web Workers, File API)
  │
  ▼
Local Processing (In-Memory Processing)
  │
  ▼
Output Rendered / Download Result
  │
  ▼
No Server Upload (Zero Cloud Transmission)
```

### Technical Features
- **Client-Side Sandbox:** All tools execute locally within the user's web browser using HTML5 Canvas, iFrames, Web Workers, and JavaScript APIs. Data, images, text, and documents never leave the local environment.
- **Data Isolation:** Zero tracking cookies, identity registration, or cloud storage logging.
- **Organic SEO Philosophy:** Meta tag generation, thumbnail checks, and layout preview tools focus strictly on formatting and optimization. Automated bots, fake view manipulators, or artificial engagement loops are strictly prohibited.

---

## Technology Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6+)
- Canvas API
- File API
- Blob API
- Web Workers
- Local Storage API
- iFrame API
- Web Audio API

