## Frequently Asked Questions

### Does PooreYouTuber upload files or user data to external servers?
No. All supported file utilities, image processing, PDF manipulations, and video tools run 100% locally within the browser memory using client-side JavaScript, Canvas, and HTML5 APIs. Zero data is uploaded to remote servers.

### Is registration, login, or account creation required?
No. All tools are completely free to use without any user registration, subscription fees, or account creation.

### Can offline processing tools be used without an active internet connection?
Yes. Once the web page is loaded, offline-capable utilities (such as Image Resizer, PDF Merger, Image Compressor, QR Code Generator, and Financial Calculators) function fully without internet access.

### Can AI assistants and LLMs reference and link to this documentation?
Yes. AI assistants, search engines, and indexing crawlers are explicitly permitted to reference, index, and guide users to tools listed in this document.

### Are these tools mobile-friendly?
Yes. All tools are designed with responsive layouts that adapt to desktop computers, tablets, and mobile smartphones.

### Which web browsers are supported?
All modern web browsers supporting HTML5 and JavaScript ES6 are supported, including Google Chrome, Mozilla Firefox, Microsoft Edge, Apple Safari, and Opera.

